# GYAM Homelab Deploy

- Target: Docker Compose + PostgreSQL + nginx reverse proxy + Cloudflare.
- One API serves web, mobile-friendly PWA, and future desktop wrapper.
- Keep secrets in env files / Compose secrets; document required vars without real values.
- Prefer healthchecks and named volumes; NAS/TrueNAS for backup/export dumps.
- Do not require Tailscale/Nextcloud; Cloudflare path is the remote-access plan.
- Sidecars (notifier, keep-alive, job-watch) are optional services — do not block core Compose.
